OL,3,ATwo murder arrests after balcony fall
OL,4,Aman dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof murder after a man who fell from a
OL,8,Fbalcony died.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to reports that
OL,11,Fthe man had fallen at flats on
OL,12,FLiverpool Street in Salford shortly
OL,13,Fafter midnight on Saturday, Greater
OL,14,FManchester Police (GMP) said.
OL,16,FThe force said the man died later that
OL,17,Fnight. A man arrested on suspicion of
OL,18,Fattempted murder has now been arrested
OL,19,Fon suspicion of murder.
OL,21,FA second man has also been arrested on
OL,22,Fsuspicion of murder.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
